No, wrong. / I don't know!

421
00:38:06,800 --> 00:38:07,700
Is it an animal?

422
00:38:08,170 --> 00:38:10,270
I don't know. It must say in there.

423
00:38:11,000 --> 00:38:13,170
Lives on the ground, but never gets dir...

424
00:38:13,170 --> 00:38:14,270
Whoa!!!

