You got ICL's offer. What are you waiting for?

543
00:51:48,630 --> 00:51:50,300
Isn't that your dream university?

544
00:51:50,300 --> 00:51:53,000
And besides, even if I study in Bournemouth,

545
00:51:53,000 --> 00:51:55,200
it's only two hours from London.

546
00:51:55,200 --> 00:51:56,600
I can come see you.

547
00:52:14,100 --> 00:52:15,070
What do I do?

548
00:52:15,500 --> 00:52:19,230
Honestly, that's not what's holding me back.

549
00:52:20,600 --> 00:52:22,970
But I've got something to deal with here first.

550
00:52:25,170 --> 00:52:26,330
I'm off.

551
00:52:32,870 --> 00:52:33,900
Fuen!

552
00:52:38,500 --> 00:52:39,400
Fuen!

553
00:52:39,400 --> 00:52:40,030
Physics.

554
00:52:40,030 --> 00:52:41,030
Fuen.

555
00:52:45,200 --> 00:52:46,200
Fuen.

556
00:52:46,800 --> 00:52:47,800
Fuen, wait.

557
00:52:52,130 --> 00:52:54,530
Fuen, listen to me first.

558
00:52:55,630 --> 00:52:57,900
Why didn't you ever think to tell me?

559
00:52:58,530 --> 00:53:01,030
You're with me almost all the time.

560
00:53:02,930 --> 00:53:04,670
And you never thought to tell me.

561
00:53:08,000 --> 00:53:10,170
What am I to you, Physics?

562
00:53:12,100 --> 00:53:13,070
Fuen.

563
00:53:14,570 --> 00:53:17,300
It's not that I meant to keep it from you.

564
00:53:20,570 --> 00:53:23,230
I was waiting for your answer.

565
00:53:23,230 --> 00:53:24,930
What answer?

566
00:53:28,830 --> 00:53:29,930
Oh.

567
00:53:32,770 --> 00:53:34,070
If I don't lie to you,

568
00:53:34,530 --> 00:53:36,470
you'll leave me, right?

569
00:53:39,000 --> 00:53:41,130
Then just leave me.

570
00:53:57,170 --> 00:54:01,370
So what? Tell me what you want me to do.

571
00:54:06,900 --> 00:54:09,000
You really want an answer that badly?

572
00:54:12,730 --> 00:54:15,170
I don't want to see your face anymore.

573
00:54:15,670 --> 00:54:16,870
Go wherever you want.

574
00:54:17,430 --> 00:54:19,230
You're so damn selfish.

575
00:54:27,430 --> 00:54:30,270
If two people truly confess their love

576
00:54:30,270 --> 00:54:33,630
as the last firework is launched into the sky,

577
00:54:33,630 --> 00:54:38,370
they'll be blessed by the sacred spirits, just as they once were.

578
00:54:54,470 --> 00:54:57,300
I don't know what to do anymore.

579
00:54:58,470 --> 00:55:01,170
This is our whole life we're talking about.

580
00:55:25,630 --> 00:55:27,400
You're not alone, Mii.

581
00:55:28,230 --> 00:55:29,630
You still have me.

582
00:55:46,230 --> 00:55:49,930
Didn't you tell me to trust your actions?

583
00:55:59,770 --> 00:56:03,670
"Didn't you tell me to trust your actions?"

584
00:56:04,500 --> 00:56:07,670
If we talk in here, it's not cheating, right?

585
00:56:07,670 --> 00:56:09,370
But let me care for you better.

586
00:56:09,370 --> 00:56:11,170
This is our whole life.

587
00:56:11,170 --> 00:56:12,170
Go wherever you want.

588
00:56:13,030 --> 00:56:14,100
You're so damn selfish.

589
00:56:27,300 --> 00:56:31,670
"Din always came to my room. This time, I want to be the one to come to you." (Star)

590
00:56:31,670 --> 00:56:33,830
"What I want to say is about Rei. I have my reasons."

591
00:56:33,830 --> 00:56:36,370
"Long ago we made a deal that I'd stay with him and let him keep pursuing me..." (Star)

592
00:56:36,630 --> 00:56:37,870
"Because I know I can't be away from you. Having you by my side"

593
00:56:37,870 --> 00:56:39,000
"is what I'm used to. Even one day apart feels wrong."

594
00:56:39,000 --> 00:56:40,270
"That's how I knew I like you. Not Star... But what you just did"

595
00:56:40,270 --> 00:56:41,770
"was walk away, keep your distance, and you didn't even... give me time to prepare." (Fuen)

596
00:56:42,130 --> 00:56:43,030
My bad, Physics.

597
00:56:43,030 --> 00:56:44,800
But I love your brother like crazy.

598
00:56:44,800 --> 00:56:47,330
Do you know how hard you made my brother cry?

599
00:56:47,330 --> 00:56:48,900
Hey! Physics!

600
00:56:52,170 --> 00:56:53,300
I'm asking seriously.

601
00:56:53,300 --> 00:56:56,930
Did you ever care, or ever think about me at all?

602
00:56:56,930 --> 00:56:58,270
I've had enough

603
00:56:58,270 --> 00:56:59,530
of everything about you.

604
00:56:59,530 --> 00:57:01,070
I get that you're mad at me.

605
00:57:01,070 --> 00:57:03,300
But when you said you didn't want to see my face,

606
00:57:03,300 --> 00:57:04,300
I was lost.

607
00:57:04,300 --> 00:57:05,130
What about me?

608
00:57:05,130 --> 00:57:06,000
What's my score?

609
00:57:06,370 --> 00:57:08,100
I already answered that day.

610
00:57:08,700 --> 00:57:10,430
That day was that day.

611
00:57:10,430 --> 00:57:13,330
Today, I want to know how much of your heart I've won.
